    "description": "\"Do you like trivia quiz shows? Have you ever dreamed of competing in a trivia contest like \"who wants to be a millionaire\" and walking towards victory knowing the step-by-step questions? We present to you our Trivia Show game, where you can experience a TV Quiz Show with all the excitement on your phone. Now is the time to challenge your knowledge and raise your level of knowledge with tens of thousands of questions in every category! Trivia Show is a trivia game where you can learn while having fun answering lots of original questions that you can't find anywhere else.\r\n\r\nThere are more than 20000 new and original questions in our game in General Knowledge, History, Literature, Sports, Music and many other categories. It offers an excellent gaming experience, especially for those who want to learn new information. Our game has been designed with an experience and excitement setup similar to millionaire quizzes broadcast on television all over the world. Experience the latest and highest quality questions among the games in the field of trivia with the pleasure of competition. You can also see your place in the leaderboard and your ranking in the world in our game, which can be enjoyed by everyone who solves brain tests and is curious about intelligence questions. You can contribute to your personal development by seeing the statistical information about each game you play and the answers you give. We are here with a full quiz. Increase your general knowledge with our trivia game that tastes like an Iq test. The strongest competitor of Wheel of Fortune, word game, word puzzle, hangman and other Trivia games. It will be beneficial for your numerical and verbal intelligence development and you will increase your vocabulary.\r\n\r\nNow tirivia addicts have a new address to turn heads. Trivia Show starts out as an easy and free quiz, and the difficulty level increases as you know the questions.\r\n\r\nEnjoy knowledge and learning new things!\r\n- Train your brain with our free trivia game\r\n- Answer multiple choice questions correctly within the time limit\r\n- Choose from categories with tens of thousands of questions on general culture, food, animals, sports, music, movies, TV shows, brands, science, nature, geography, history, famous people, philosophers, quotes, religious topics and more!\r\n- If you have trouble finding the answer, you can get hints by using life lines\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURES:\r\n- Tens of thousands of questions\r\n- Different categories in many fields\r\n- All questions are arranged by difficulty level. The more you solve the questions, the more difficult the questions come to you.\r\n- Test your knowledge level, general culture and IQ\r\n- Learn valuable and little known information while playing our game\r\n- Fluent user experience and excellent game interface\r\n- Phone and tablet support\r\n- Learn new things by constantly increasing your knowledge level\r\n- Become a trivia master\r\n- An excellent brain training game!\r\n- You can play offline or online anytime, anywhere\r\n\r\nDownload our free best option for quiz and trivia fans and step into your trivia addiction!\r\n\r\nIf you wish, you can contribute to our question pool by sending us questions, so you can win gems and use new jokers. Gems are in-game values in the Trivia Show. Using gems you can use extra lives, hints and other useful options. If you want to have more gems, you can buy them from the in-game store. You can also earn gems by sharing our game, sending us questions or buying them with different options.\r\n\r\nJOKERS / LIFELINES IN THE GAME:\r\n- With the \"Double Chance\" lifeline, you have the right to choose 2 out of 4 options. If you answered incorrectly, you have a chance to answer again.\r\n- With the \"Half and Half\" lifeline, you eliminate two wrong answers from the question.\r\n- You can find out the wise man's opinion on the correct answer with the \"Ask an Knower\" joker.\r\n\r\nThe prizes and money in our game are not real, they are virtual prizes added to increase the fun and add excitement to the game.\"",
